    ["\n　　……\n　　失踪者家属聚集警局门口抗议，警方表示“失踪案件均已登记处理”。据悉，近期此类事件已发生十余起，多为政府雇员。\n　　……\n\n<Note_Normal_HW>这些是我们的人，这家伙在干嘛！</>\n<Note_Normal_HW>他疯了，赶紧处理掉，不要留下把柄！</>\n<Note_Normal_HW>查理先生马上要参选了，这时候不能出任何丑闻！</>"] = "\n　　……\n　　Families of the missing gathered at the police station to protest, and the police stated that \"all disappearance cases have been registered and processed.\" It is reported that more than ten such incidents have occurred recently, mostly government employees.\n　　……\n\n</>These are our people, what is this guy doing!</>\n</>He's crazy, deal with it quickly, don't leave any evidence!</>\n</>Mr. Charlie is about to run for office, there can't be any scandals at this time!</>",
